The message "[RAGE] Players left safe area, classes now locked!" displays multiple times because `player_left_start_area` fires once per player leaving the safe area, not once per team.

**Changes:**
- Added `LeftSafeAreaMessageShown` flag to track message display state per round
- Modified `Event_LeftStartArea` to print message only on first invocation
- Reset flag in round initialization functions (`OnMapStart`, `OnMapEnd`, `ResetPlugin`, `Event_RoundChange`)

```cpp
public Action:Event_LeftStartArea(Handle:event, const String:name[], bool:dontBroadcast)
{
    RoundStarted = true;
    if (!LeftSafeAreaMessageShown)
    {
        LeftSafeAreaMessageShown = true;
        PrintToChatAll("%s Players left safe area, classes now locked!", PRINT_PREFIX);
    }
}
```

