### Summary

Moves dynamic / config-dependent TypeScript type references from the project root `next-env.d.ts` to `.next/types/next-env.d.ts`. 

- Users don't need to think about it - tsconfig.json already includes .next/types/**/*.ts
- Dynamic types live alongside other generated types (routes.d.ts, validator.ts) are under `.next` which won't bother git changes


#### Before

`next-env.d.ts` (project root):
```typescript
/// <reference types="next" />
/// <reference types="next/image-types/global" />

// NOTE: This file should not be edited
// see https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/config/typescript for more information.
```

#### After

`.next/types/next-env.d.ts` (generated):
```typescript
/// <reference types="next" />
/// <reference types="next/image-types/global" />
import "./routes.d.ts"
```
